        "ratings": [
            {
                "comment": "John is a very caring professor and you get the impression that he cares about your progress. The class is divided into three \"portfolios,\" with a few other assignments that sometimes feel like busy work. Overall, Professor Mulvihill gives great feedback and is a fun lecturer and I would highly recommend it to anyone who must take English 100. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "I really enjoyed having Professor Mulvihill this semester, he gives very good feedback when needed and really cares about his students. I will say there are a good amount of assignments assigned on canvas, however they are all manageable. If you are looking for a good professor for English, I would totally recommend Professor Mulvihill. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "He is one of my favorite professors.",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Very professional class. Dr. Mulvihill really cares that you become a better writer. Class was more writing heavy than reading, which I really liked. We had 1 on 1 meetings to go over drafts of every writing assignment which was awesome. Take the class seriously and you'll do well and learn a lot",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "I took this class to satisfy a Comm A requirement. John was an amazing professor. Some of the homework he assigned seemed like busy work, but it was overall a great class. He was very informative, respectful, and helpful. Outside of class, he could be easily accessed. It's disappointing that I won't be able to take another class with him. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Professor Mulvihill was one of the best professors I have had. He was very easy to get in contact with and responded within an hour. He was always willing to Zoom if you needed clarification or help on an assignment. He also would read each students' paper and meet with them to give feedback and advice. He was a very nice guy! 100% recommend!!",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Professor Mulhivill is so cute and sweet and he is so funny. I actually made a lot of friends in his classes and he has awesome activities and lectures. If you want to take a class you learn a lot and are entertained in, I would recommend taking this class! He's awesome!",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "He is a great professor. Had this class during the ongoing pandemic and he was very considerate. He would always reassure us that if we ever needed help we could contact him. He answered his emails asap. Never got to meet him in person but I really appreciated how he taught while online.",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "By far one of the most amazing professors. He was always super accomodating and clearly cared about his students. As long as you make an effort in this class, it should be an easy A. He is one of the kindest, most down to earth professors. Highly recommend. Wish I could've taken a second class with him.",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Professor Mulvihill is a really kind and caring guy, so nice. However, there is a lot of busy work assigned that is due every class. Participation is 20% so you have to go to class. He gives great feedback on essays and truly cares about his students.",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Very nice guy, good teacher. A lot of busy work that are tedious and repetitive. Be prepared to put a lot of effort into a 3 credit course.",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
